---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';import {modules} from '../../data/modules';
---
<Layout title="Product Tour | Explore SEMS-ERP" description="Take a guided look at SEMS-ERP school management workflows, from student admissions and attendance to fee management, coursework and reporting.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Explore the experience</span><h1 class="h1">See how the pieces <span class="text-indigo">fit together.</span></h1><p class="lead">Take a guided tour through SEMS-ERP's key workflows. The visual preview below is illustrative; the module descriptions reflect the application's inspected source.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Live Demonstration ↗</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/features/">Explore Features →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><figure class="tour-screen" style="max-width:990px;margin:auto"><img src="/images/product/dashboard-preview.png" alt="Illustrative SEMS-ERP dashboard concept with sample data" width="1536" height="1024"/><figcaption>Illustrative dashboard concept from the existing website. Not a verified screenshot of the production interface.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="editorial-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">What a real demonstration covers</span><h2 class="h2">From screen to completed task.</h2></div><div><p>Rather than showing a dashboard in isolation, a useful demonstration follows the actions staff take: opening the right workspace, choosing records, saving changes and reviewing the outcome.</p><p>The illustration above is not a screenshot of the production system. A guided demo can show the actual interface with appropriate sample data.</p></div></div><div class="process-rail">{[{t:'Choose a workspace',d:'Open a module appropriate to the user role.'},{t:'Find the records',d:'Use available class, student, period or status filters.'},{t:'Complete the task',d:'Enter, review or update information through the module.'},{t:'Check the outcome',d:'Review the saved record, print a document or export where supported.'}].map((x,i)=><div class="process-card"><span class="process-index">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{x.t}</h3><p>{x.d}</p></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Guided workflows</span><h2 class="h2">A tour of the school day.</h2><p class="lead">Choose a module to see its capabilities and the workflow behind it.</p></div><div class="grid2">{modules.map(m=><article class="feature-card"><span class="eyebrow">TOUR {m.number}</span><h3 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-top:12px">{m.title}</h3><p>{m.intro}</p><ul class="check-list">{m.workflow.slice(0,3).map(s=><li>{s}</li>)}</ul><a href={`/features/${m.slug}/`}>See module details →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</span><h2 class="h2">Before your demonstration.</h2></div><div style="max-width:800px;margin:auto"><details class="faq"><summary>Can we see the real application?</summary><p>Yes. Request a demonstration and tell us which school workflows you want to explore. The image on this page is an illustrative concept, not a live application screenshot.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Does every user see the same modules?</summary><p>No. SEMS-ERP includes role-aware navigation and school feature entitlements. Available areas depend on the assigned role and school configuration.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Does the system automatically send WhatsApp fee reminders?</summary><p>Not as a verified production feature. The current fee-reminder interface contains a simulation; live external delivery is not advertised.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Does the attendance module connect to biometric devices?</summary><p>The current gate interface is a simulator. A production hardware integration has not been verified.</p></details></div></div></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
